OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant' smoke warning from
OL,4,Aheath fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been advised to keep
OL,7,Ftheir doors and windows closed due to a
OL,8,Fheath fire creating a "significant
OL,9,Famount of smoke".
OL,11,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService said it is currently dealing
OL,13,Fwith a fire on Canford Heath.
OL,15,FIt has asked people to avoid the area
OL,16,Fwhile crews try to bring the fire under
OL,17,Fcontrol.
OL,19,FThe BBC has approached the fire service
OL,20,Ffor more details.
